  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">⭐ <em>The incredible immersive projection concert LUMINISCENCE comes to Westminster Cathedral to tell the story of London, voiced by star of Paddington and Downton Abbey, </em><strong><em>Hugh Bonneville</em></strong><em>.</em> ⭐</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/0df1b472-8430-11f1-aaf9-da152dd4c6d7.jpg\" style=\"border-radius: 12px; width: 100%; max-width: 800px\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">After captivating over 2 million spectators across the world and its hugely successful UK debut in Manchester, <strong>LUMINISCENCE </strong>arrives in London to transform <strong>Westminster Cathedral </strong>in breathtaking ways, with a dazzling 360° video projection concert.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Hear the story of London and one of its most important cathedrals in a specially commissioned script by <strong>BAFTA and Olivier Award winner Tim Whitnall</strong>, voiced by star of <strong>Paddington and Downton Abbey, Hugh Bonneville</strong>, and blended with live performances of classical music’s greatest composers brought to life by the phenomenal <strong>Lux Aeterna </strong>choir.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>ONE EXPERIENCE, TWO INCREDIBLE MUSICAL VERSIONS</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>LUMINISCENCE</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Description of image\" src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/5a11f8c2-4aff-11f1-8641-a6e69961bda6.jpg\" style=\"border-radius: 12px; width: 100%; max-width: 800px\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>📅 Performances from July 1st<br>\r\n💶 From £27.50<br>\r\n🎶 Experience an unprecedented audio-visual immersion<br>\r\nTreat yourself to a one-of-a-kind experience with the exceptional Lux Aeterna live choir in a majestic setting</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>LUMINISCENCE Orchestra Nights</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/3b2e60c0-8430-11f1-a419-4a366c6a12ca.jpg\" style=\"border-radius: 12px; width: 100%; max-width: 800px\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>📅 Performances from 5th September<br>\r\n💶 From £42.90<br>\r\n🎶 An extraordinary sound experience<br>\r\nLet yourself be carried away by the live LUMINISCENCE 14-piece orchestra and Lux Aeterna during an unforgettable immersive experience</p>\r\n\r\n<p>🪑 <strong>Categories</strong><br>\r\n<strong>Gold Category</strong>: the rear section of the nave with the very best panoramic view<br>\r\n<strong>Silver Category</strong>: the centre to the front of the nave</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/f2ff2f68-73a0-11f1-bc18-ca85cfb77a1b.png\" width=\"300px\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🏆 The London premiere of this spectacular experience that has already dazzled over two million spectators across the world and thousands at its critically acclaimed UK debut in Manchester<br>\r\n💎 A breathtaking 360-degree cutting-edge video-mapping experience that brings to life the story of London and one of its most important cathedrals<br>\r\n🗣️ A specially commissioned script by BAFTA and Olivier Award-winning writer Tim Whitnall voiced by star of Paddington and Downton Abbey, Hugh Bonneville<br>\r\n✨ Show Exclusive! Westminster Cathedral’s, never completed, mosaic adorned domes are digitally brought to life for the very first time in the architect's original vision<br>\r\n🎶 Live musical performances of some of classical music's greatest composers, performed by the Lux Aeterna choir<br>\r\n🕍 Check out LUMINISCENCE Orchestra Nights: Live+ 14-piece orchestra and Lux Aeterna choir select sessions<br>\r\n⛪ A one-of-a-kind chance to (re)discover one of London’s most iconic landmarks<br>\r\n👨‍👩‍👧 A magical experience to enjoy with your partner, friends, or family<br>\r\n⭐ Fast-track entry and best views seating for Gold ticket holders<br>\r\n🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for LUMINISCENCE: The new 360° projection concert at London’s Westminster Cathedral <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/647324\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: approximately 50 minutes<br>\r\n🚪 Doors open 30 minutes before showtime<br>\r\n📍 Location: Westminster Cathedral<br>\r\n👤 Age requirement: no minimum age<br>\r\n🪑 A seated show with tiered pricing according to best views<br>\r\n🎟️ Group and Family ticket rates available<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: venue is wheelchair accessible<br>\r\n❓ Check the FAQs for this experience <a href=\"https://luminiscence.com/london/#faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></p>",
